#: ../../electronic/defects_migration.rst:4
msgid "点欠陥と原子の移動"
msgstr "Point Defects and Atomic Migration"

#: ../../electronic/defects_migration.rst:6
msgid "結晶や非晶質の中で原子が抜けた位置などの点欠陥を考え、欠陥を作るのに要るエネルギーと、欠陥を介して原子が隣の位置へ移るときに越えるエネルギー障壁を求めます。"
msgstr ""
"Consider point defects, such as sites where atoms are missing in crystals"
" or amorphous materials. Learn how to calculate the energy needed to form"
" a defect and the energy barrier an atom must cross to move to a "
"neighboring site via a defect."

